\dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \uc1 \u8212 ?But let\uc1 \u8217 ?s come back: the problem with the\uc1 \u160 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 other\uc1 \u160 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 origin of the \uc1 \u8220 ?good,\uc1 \u8221 ? of the good man, as the person of }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 ressentiment }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 has imagined it for himself, demands its own conclusion.\uc1 \u8212 ?That the lambs are upset about the great predatory birds is not strange, but the fact that these large birds of prey snatch away small lambs provides no reason for holding anything against them. And if the lambs say among themselves, \uc1 \u8220 ?These predatory birds are evil, and whoever is least like a predatory bird and instead is like its opposite, a lamb\uc1 \u8212 ?shouldn\uc1 \u8217 ?t that animal be good?\uc1 \u8221 ? there is nothing to find fault with in this setting up of an ideal, except for the fact that the birds of prey will look down on them with a little mockery and perhaps say to themselves, \uc1 \u8220 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 We\uc1 \u160 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 are not at all annoyed with these good lambs. We even love them. Nothing is tastier than a tender lamb.\uc1 \u8221 ? To demand from strength that it does\uc1 \u160 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 not\uc1 \u160 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 express itself\uc1 \u160 ?as strength, that it does}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025  not\uc1 \u160 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 consist of a will to overpower, a will to throw down, a will to rule, a thirst for enemies and opposition and triumphs, is just as unreasonable as to demand from weakness that it express itself as strength. A quantum of force is simply such a quantum of drive, will, and action\uc1 \u8212 ?rather, it is nothing but this very driving, willing, and acting itself\uc1 \u8212 ?and it cannot appear as anything else except through the seduction of language (and the fundamental errors of reason petrified in it), which understands and misunderstands all action as conditioned by something which causes actions, by a \uc1 \u8220 ?subject.\uc1 \u8221 ?}{\cs15 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \af5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \super1 \chftn {\footnote \pard \plain \s20 \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \sa60 \lisa0 \nosnaplinegrid \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs18 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs20 \ltrch \fcs0 \cs15 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \af5 \super1 \chftn }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs20 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs20 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 Grammatically, the part of a sentence (\uc1 \u8220 ?the doer\uc1 \u8221 ?) that performs the action being described. In terms of epistemology, the subject is the basis for knowledge. For example, according to Schopenhauer, the knowing subject seeks release from the all-desiring will.}}}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025  For, in just the same way as people separate lightning from its flash and take the latter as an\uc1 \u160 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 action}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 , as the effect of a subject called lightning, so popular morality separates strength from manifestations of strength, as if behind the strong person there were an indifferent substrate that is}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025  free\uc1 \u160 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 to express strength or not. But there is no such substrate; there is no \uc1 \u8220 ?being\uc1 \u8221 ? behind the doing, acting, or becoming. \uc1 \u8220 ?The doer\uc1 \u8221 ? is merely fabricated and added into the action\uc1 \u8212 ?the act is everything. People basically duplicate the action: when they see a lightning flash, that is an action-action }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 [ein Thun-Thun]}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 : they set up the same event first as the cause and then yet again as its effect. Natural scientists are no better when they say \uc1 \u8220 ?Force moves, force causes,\uc1 \u8221 ? and so on\uc1 \u8212 ?our entire scientific knowledge, for all its coolness and freedom from feelings, still remains exposed to the seduction of language and has not gotten rid of the changelings foisted on it, the \uc1 \u8220 ?subjects\uc1 \u8221 ? (the atom, for example, is such a changeling, like the Kantian \uc1 \u8220 ?thing-in-itself\uc1 \u8221 ?}{\cs15 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \af5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \super1 \chftn {\footnote \pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \sa60 \lisa0 \nosnaplinegrid \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs20 \ltrch \fcs0 \cs15 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \af5 \super1 \chftn }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs20 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs20 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 The \uc1 \u8220 ?thing-in-itself\uc1 \u8221 ? is Kant\uc1 \u8217 ?s term for irreducible reality. Not perceivable by the senses, its existence can be intellectually deduced only from appearances. In Nietzsche\uc1 \u8217 ?s time, the atom had been postulated by Ernst Mach (1836\uc1 \u8211 ?1916), but only as an idealized mental construct and not as an actual unit of matter.}}}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 : it\uc1 \u8217 ?s no wonder, then, that the repressed, secretly smouldering feelings of revenge and hate use this belief for their own purposes and even, in fact, maintain a faith in nothing more fervently than in the idea that\uc1 \u160 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 the strong person is free\uc1 \u160 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 to be weak and that the predatory bird is free to be a lamb:\uc1 \u8212 ?in so doing, of course, they arrogate to themselves the right to}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025  blame }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 the bird of prey for being a bird of prey\uc1 \u8230 ?. When the oppressed, the downtrodden, and the violated say to each other, with the vengeful cunning of the powerless, \uc1 \u8220 ?Let us be different from evil people, namely, good! And every person is good who does not oppress, who hurts no one, who does not attack, who does not retaliate, who hands revenge over to God, who keeps himself hidden, as we do, the person who avoids all evil and demands little from life in general, like us, the patient, humble, and upright\uc1 \u8221 ?\uc1 \u8212 ?what that amounts to, coolly expressed and without bias, is essentially nothing more than \uc1 \u8220 ?We weak people are merely weak. It\uc1 \u8217 ?s good if we do not do anything }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 for which we are not strong enough}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \uc1 \u8221 ?\uc1 \u8212 ?but this bitter state, this shrewdness of the lowest ranks, which even insects possess (when in great danger they act as if they were dead in order not to do \uc1 \u8220 ?too much\uc1 \u8221 ?), has, thanks to that counterfeiting and self-deception of powerlessness, dressed itself in the splendour of a self-denying, still, patient virtue, as if the weakness of the weak man himself\uc1 \u8212 ?that means his\uc1 \u160 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 essence}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 , his actions, his entire single, inevitable, and irredeemable reality\uc1 \u8212 ?is a voluntary achievement, something willed, chosen, an }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 action, something of merit}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 . This kind of man }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 has to }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 believe in the disinterested, freely choosing \uc1 \u8220 ?subject\uc1 \u8221 ? out of an instinct for self- preservation and self-affirmation, in which every falsehood is habitually sanctified. Hence, the subject (or, to use a more popular style, the\uc1 \u160 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 soul}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 ) has up to now perhaps been the best principle for belief on earth, because for the majority of the dying, the weak, and the downtrodden of all sorts it makes possible that sublime self-deception that establishes weakness itself as freedom and their being like this or that as\uc1 \u160 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 a commendable act}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 .}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \tql \tx1200 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \par }\pard \plain \qc \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \tql \tx1200 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af