105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 was made flesh\uc1 \u8212 ?we should consider well\uc1 \u160 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 what\uc1 \u160 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 a problem that is: Napoleon, this synthesis of }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 monster [Unmensch]\uc1 \u160 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 and\uc1 \u160 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 superman [\uc1 \u220 ?bermensch]}{\cs15 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \af5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \super1 \chftn {\footnote \pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \sa60 \lisa0 \nosnaplinegrid \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \tql \tx1200 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs20 \ltrch \fcs0 \cs15 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \af5 \super1 \chftn }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs20 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs20 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 Napol\uc1 \u233 ?on Bonaparte (1769\uc1 \u8211 ?1821), Corsican military officer who came to prominence during the French Revolution and the wars that followed. First Consul (1799\uc1 \u8211 ?1804) and then Emperor of France (1804\uc1 \u8211