af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025  not}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 , like the other arts, offering copies of phenomena, but rather speaking out as the voice of the will itself speaking out directly from the \uc1 \u8220 ?abyss,\uc1 \u8221 ?\uc1 \u8221 ? as its most authentic, most primordial, least derivative revelation. With this extraordinary increase in the value of music, as this seemed to grow out of Schopenhauer\uc1 \u8217 ?s philosophy,\uc1 \u160 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 the musician\uc1 \u160 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 himself also suddenly grew in value to an unheard-of extent: from now on he would be an oracle, a priest, more than a priest, in fact, a kind of mouthpiece of the \uc1 \u8220 ?essence\uc1 \u8221 ? of things, a telephone from the world beyond\uc1 \u8212 ?in future he didn\uc1 \u8217 ?t speak only of music, this ventriloquist of God\uc1 \u8212 ?he talked metaphysics. Is it any wonder that finally one day he spoke about ascetic }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 ideals}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 ? \uc1 \u8230 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \as