ed by Joseph Haydn (1732\uc1 \u8211 ?1809) in 1796 as a hymn to the Austrian emperor. The song was officially adopted as the German national anthem in 1922 during the Weimar Republic, retained with modifications by the Nazi regime, reestablished in 1951 by West Germany, and in 1991, after the fall of the Berlin Wall, reinstated as the national hymn of the reunified country.}}}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025  as well as the\uc1 \u160 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 paralysis agitans [trembling palsy]\uc1 \u160 ? }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 of \uc1 \u8220 ?modern ideas\uc1 \u8221 ?). Today Europe is rich and resourceful, above all, in ways of arousing people. Nothing seems to be more important to possess than }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 stimulantia [stimulants] }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 and firewater: hence, the monstrous falsification of ideals, the most powerful firewater of the spirit. Hence also the unfavorable, stinking, lying, pseudo-alcoholic air everywhere. I\uc1 \u8217 ?d like to know how many shiploads of counterfeit idealism, of heroic costumes and rattles full of nonsensical big words, how many tons of sugary spiritual sympathy (its business name:\uc1 \u160 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 